{
  "_comment": "The DSL grammar this skill writes and validate.py enforces. Mirrors the editor's own tables (web/lib/eventstorming/{elements,levels,relations,context-relations}.ts and DSL_VERSION); web/tests/skill-grammar-guard.test.ts fails if the two disagree. \"*\" means every element type.",
  "dslVersion": "4.0",
